    "decay": {"5d_ic": 0.00038985, "10d_ic": 0.00450763, "20d_ic": 0.01443487, "40d_ic": 0.02145997},
    "regime_notes": "Validated over many regimes in a 15-instrument cross-asset universe; 20D and 40D predictive strength exceed benchmark gates. Small cross-section implies conservative inference.",
